Z||000000||fieroparts.com||01-28-2001||05:14 PM||||<BR>I have spoken with other well-respected forum members about this idea, and they love it!<P>Fiero Parts & Appraisals will be raffling off one NEW T-TOP kit.<BR>Tickets will be $50.00 each and only 60 tickets will be sold.  We will draw<BR>The winner on June 16, 2001 at the 6th Annual Fiero Owner’s Club of New England<BR>Summer show.  If we reach 60 sold tickets 40 days (or more) prior to the show, we will<BR>Pick a new date and time to hold the drawing, with club officers present.  You need not be present to win.<BR>All are welcome for the drawing.  If you are not present and you win shipping is NOT included, we can ship it for you at your expense.  <P>This is the nice part Fiero Parts & Appraisals will donate up to<BR>$1,000.00 from this raffle to the Anthony Barber fund. I have no question we can get 60 Fiero owners<BR>to buy the 60 tickets, and do something good for a Fiero friend, and maybe you will win a t-top kit in the process!  If you have no idea who<BR>Anthony Barber is please see this link at    <A HREF="http://www.fieroforum.com/barber/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroforum.com/barber/</A>  <P><BR>PLEASE follow the directions below:<P>Reply to this post ONLY the number of tickets you want to buy.<BR>Then email me the same at tim@fieroparts.com<BR>Then send $50.00 for each ticket in the form of a POSTAL MONEY ORDER ONLY!<BR>Along with a self addressed stamped #10 envelope to:<BR>Tim Perrigo One Fiero Drive  Old Orchard Beach, Maine 04064<BR>Any questions email ME. If for some reason we do not reach the<BR>magic number of 60 we will return the money order you sent.<BR>Please include your phone number, email address and your screen name used here.<BR>Your ticket number(s) will be kept on file and emailed to you.<BR>Help keep this post on top so all will see it.<P>If you disagree with this idea  POST IT ON YOUR BATHROOM WALL, NOT HERE!<P>Thank you,||||reg||14
Z||000001||BAM-BAM||01-28-2001||06:17 PM|||| Cudos Tim, I think it's a great idea. This is the kind of support that the Fiero Community needs from it's largest family. I'm sure that there will be plenty of members who would wager the $50.00 against a $2000.00+ T-Top kit. Even if you don't win the raffle, you have done a great deal to help someone who needs it. Come on ladies and gentlemen, step right up and join on in. This could be your lucky day!!!! Start saving those nickles and dimes.<P> Peace, B2 OUT!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P> P.S. I will be entering the raffle, but right now I have other commitments. Look for it in about a month.<P>  Late!<p>[This message has been edited by BAM-BAM (edited 01-28-2001).]||||reg||12
