Z||000006||fieroparts.com||01-30-2001||06:52 PM||||I would not call it a donation!<BR>You are buying a ticket for $50.00<BR>We (Fiero Parts & Appraisals) will be<BR>making up to a $1,000.00 donation. ? up to<BR>$1,000.00 means 1/3 all ticket sales.<BR>We would like to sell all of the 60 tickets,<BR>if we do not sell 50 tickets this is a no go and all of the money will be returned.  The dead line<BR>is June 16th the day of the show.<BR>Not one person, out of almost 2000 forum members has purchased a ticket, the only person that has purchased a ticket was a very good customer of mine that I e-mailed a note to. In her email she said<BR>"I hope Anthony feels better soon"<BR>.?.?.<BR>Hope to see more ticket sales from forum members!<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 2M4 Dale:<BR><B>When is the cutoff date for making the $50 donation ? <P>[This message has been edited by 2M4 Dale (edited 01-30-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||14
